<title>USA: Carroll CSD, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Carroll CSD, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $5.500 million of Carroll CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.32 percent.</p>
